# Result tables and figures are generated per campaign, by
# `uv run python -m report render <campaign dir>` (run in the superproject's
# `benchmark/`), from a result store that lives outside this repository
# (`/data/bench/results/<campaign>/`). They are ignored by default so that a
# dev, smoke or pilot campaign cannot drift into the manuscript tree unnoticed.
# Each table comes three ways -- `.tex`, and for Typst a `.typ` that loads its
# `.table.json` -- and all three are covered by `results-*`.
#
# When a campaign is the one the thesis quotes, commit its tables deliberately,
# from the root of this repository:
#     git add -f generated/results-<campaign>-*.tex
#     git add -f generated/results-<campaign>-*.typ generated/results-<campaign>-*.table.json
#     git add -f generated/figures/results-<campaign>-*.tex
#
# `deviations.*` and `methods-provenance.*` (`.tex`, `.typ`, `.table.json`) are
# NOT ignored: `uv run deviations render` generates them from the manifest and
# the forks, which are in the superproject, so they are reproducible by anyone
# who clones it.
results-*
figures/
